      "content": "The Kyverno Policy Reporter REST API provides endpoints for querying PolicyReport and ClusterPolicyReport custom resources generated by Kyverno. It exposes policy results, status counts, and resource-level violation data, serving as the backend for the Policy Reporter UI. The API enables programmatic access to policy compliance status across namespaces and clusters.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kyverno Community",
